"FreeBSD.org`, our primary development machine, and for `thud.FreeBSD.org`, a "
"testing and build box. We are also indebted to them for funding various "
"contributors over the years and providing us with unrestricted use of their "
"T1 connection to the Internet."
msgstr "link:http://www.osd.bsdi.com/[BSDi]（前身为 Walnut Creek CDROM）提供了难以尽述的支持（详情请参阅 extref:{handbook}[FreeBSD 手册]中的“关于 FreeBSD 项目”部分）。特别感谢他们提供最初用于 `freefall.FreeBSD.org`（我们的主要开发机器）和 `thud.FreeBSD.org`（测试与构建机器）的硬件。多年来，他们还资助了多位贡献者，并允许我们不受限制地使用其 T1 互联网连接，我们对此深表感谢。"

#. type: Plain text
